{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04018","headline":"和杜主簿春日有所思 · 苏頲","name":"和杜主簿春日有所思","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"朝上高楼上，俯见洛阳陌。\n摇荡吹花风，落英纷已积。\n美人不共此，芳好空所惜。\n揽镜尘网滋，当窗苔藓碧。\n缅怀在云汉，良愿暌枕席。\n翻似无见时，如何久爲客。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"苏頲","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_04018.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_04018","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}